    "ImproperInstalledModDesc" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "One or more mods have been installed directly into the Mods folder. This is not recommended; the GUI performs checks on mods for validity and security and installing directly to the Mods folder bypasses this. It's easy to break the framework by doing this."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一个或多个模组已直接安装到模组文件夹中。不推荐这样做：GUI可检查模组的有效性和安全性，直接安装到模组文件夹会绕过此功能。这样做很容易破坏框架。"
